OL,3,GNEWSA'People were screaming in pain'
OL,4,Aduring Co-op Live evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FRap music fans who were evacuated from
OL,7,Fa concert after an unknown substance
OL,8,Fwas released have said there was a
OL,9,F"burning" feeling in their throat and
OL,10,Fthey started to "cough and splutter"
OL,11,Fand some people were "screaming in
OL,12,Fpain".
OL,14,FSome 12,000 people were evacuated from
OL,15,FCo-op Live Arena after the incident at
OL,16,FUS rapper Don Toliver's show at the
OL,17,FCo-op Live in Manchester at about 22:00
OL,18,FGMT on Sunday.
OL,20,FOne person was taken to hospital, and
OL,21,Fmore than 80 were assessed by
OL,22,Fparamedics.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
